# Daily review digest: the decision queues' base rows (Blog Ideas, Skill
# Proposals, Tips and Tricks, Topics, Market Watch) from the workflow database,
# filed as a brief on Today; each card opens its row on Tasks. Runs after the
# nightly generators that fill those queues, so the queues are fresh.
# Nothing pending = no brief. Exits 1 when the rows cannot be read or the
# brief could not be filed.
JOB_SCHEDULE="30 7 * * *"
JOB_COMMAND="sh \"$ROOT/../local-obsidian-review/obsidian-review.sh\" run"
